        <head>EXAMINER, SATURDAY, AUGUST 9, 1913.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, AUGUST 9, 1913.</p>
        <p>PARTNERS! nt Labour rising on the Rand has thrown light upon the appalling death rates in the mines, and the condition of !vealed suggests that lives are being needlessly sacrificed to swell the" dividends of the mining companies."</p>
