        <p>ag HELP THE CHll,—n--a_e Mr. Burns made reference to tn mortality in Lancashire. Burnle); fantile mortality of 171 per 1,001: tersea, a similar community, r tu. per 1.000. The reason why Burn e. fantile mortality of 171 per 101 humble judgment, to be found in, in Burnley too large a Percel mothers were at work, while ia mothers were at home. " I believe now that women are entering into all the phases of of industry and official and adi rani they themselves must realise tilt their offspring and the race i 8 fact is attended with consider tags to the community and the race " Can poor communities improve tiona so far as the children Fifteen years ago," he continuea, mortality rate in Battersea thousand, or what Burnley is ncl is 83. Ido not believa there ha,_s„„ provement in the wages, spewl. yet in that period infant mortal halved.</p>
        <p>ft-has happened because Batt, e prescient neighbourhood, and a Tel, trict, had the credit to see in adv.'s' country is now seeing, and, havi.of vantage, as we did, of one medici showed us how to do the work, we by him; the workmen rallied.ta standard, and the result is this ( saving of infant life in a working '</p>
        <p>A BLACK SPOT., "Lancashire is industrial; iLs a marvel to everybody. Coinra prosperous, and, broadly epeaktri have regular work and relativeo; No county in the kingdom has a ism, but it stands highest in the 1 mortality—much lower than it Iva' enough. In some places, where and children are consequently. of three to four times what it la and Belgravia, and double or tre- where women of the same class 43,1 "I hold strongly the view tha' four months before the child is longer after the child is born, 111.1 be mothers and not machines. "In a Birmingham area the 11 tality is 200 per 1.000. There 8° the mothers work in factories frol which they leave school; 61 per c to work after marriage. Surely 011 it can be said thet where industr"; married women labour, their eill,ll "I hope that this conference wu what is true of Birmingham an' true of Preston and many other d: which. 'however, are infinitely 11 regard than they were seven years</p>
