      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-08-09_WidnesExaminer_art0273" n="art0273">
        <head>ANDREWS' PICTURE PALACE.</head>
        <p>ANDREWS' PICTURE PALACE.</p>
        <p>A sensational production. " On the Track of the Spider's League." will be the principal pic- ture at Andrews' Electric Theatre, on Monday, Tuesday and Wednesday next, and should draw large houses. It is 'a detective drama of many sensations, including a daring walk across a tight rope, suspended from one,liieli building to. another.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-08-09_WidnesExaminer_art0274" n="art0274">
        <head>BLACK SMOKE.</head>
        <gap reason="ocrQuality" quantity="2" unit="words">
